      "richText": "<article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"/chillinh/AntiBridge-Antigravity-remote/blob/main/media/Logo_AntiBridge.png\"><img src=\"/chillinh/AntiBridge-Antigravity-remote/raw/main/media/Logo_AntiBridge.png\" width=\"200\" alt=\"AntiBridge Logo\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">AntiBridge</h1><a id=\"user-content-antibridge\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: AntiBridge\" href=\"#antibridge\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>A bridge between your phone and Antigravity.</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/linhbq82/Antibridge_Remote_Antigravity/releases\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a6afbd45310001ba2cf97aec51d22a93fff1cff9d94dc432607094715cbde433/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f76657273696f6e2d332e372e312d626c75652e737667\" alt=\"Version\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/version-3.7.1-blue.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n<a href=\"/chillinh/AntiBridge-Antigravity-remote/blob/main/LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/8bb50fd2278f18fc326bf71f6e88ca8f884f72f179d3e555e20ed30157190d0d/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f6c6963656e73652d4d49542d677265656e2e737667\" alt=\"License\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://nodejs.org/en/download/current\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/092e0007be85a7ff2897fc519179f0288db62202dfda73be27b46cb89cdaa3d6/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f6e6f64652d25334525334431382e302e302d627269676874677265656e2e737667\" alt=\"Node\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/node-%3E%3D18.0.0-brightgreen.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>Control Antigravity AI from your phone, tablet, or any device with a browser</em></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">🎯 What is AntiBridge?</h2><a id=\"user-content--what-is-antibridge\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🎯 What is AntiBridge?\" href=\"#-what-is-antibridge\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>AntiBridge</strong> is a web-based remote control interface for <a href=\"https://antigravity.google\" rel=\"nofollow\">Antigravity AI</a>. Send prompts, switch AI models, and control your AI agent from anywhere using your phone or any browser.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">🔗 Related Project</h3><a id=\"user-content--related-project\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🔗 Related Project\" href=\"#-related-project\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Project</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>🤖 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/linhbq82/Antibridge-autoaccep-for-antigravity\">AntiBridge-AutoAccept</a></strong></td>\n<td>Companion extension for auto-accepting AI actions</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">🚀 Quick Start</h2><a id=\"user-content--quick-start\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🚀 Quick Start\" href=\"#-quick-start\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Requirements</h3><a id=\"user-content-requirements\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Requirements\" href=\"#requirements\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>✅ <strong>Node.js</strong> v18 or higher (<a href=\"https://nodejs.org/en/download/current\" rel=\"nofollow\">Download</a>)</li>\n<li>✅ <strong>Antigravity</strong> installed (<a href=\"https://antigravity.google\" rel=\"nofollow\">Download</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">⚡ 3 Steps to Launch</h3><a id=\"user-content--3-steps-to-launch\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: ⚡ 3 Steps to Launch\" href=\"#-3-steps-to-launch\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Step</th>\n<th>Action</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>1️⃣</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Double-click</strong> <code>OPEN_ANTIGRAVITY_CDP.bat</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>2️⃣</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Right-click</strong> <code>START_SERVER.bat</code> → <strong>Run as Administrator</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>3️⃣</strong></td>\n<td>Access <code>http://YOUR_IP:8000</code> from your phone</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">📱 Find Your PC's IP Address</h3><a id=\"user-content--find-your-pcs-ip-address\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 📱 Find Your PC's IP Address\" href=\"#-find-your-pcs-ip-address\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"1. Open CMD (Windows + R → type &quot;cmd&quot; → Enter)\n2. Type: ipconfig\n3. Find &quot;IPv4 Address&quot; → That's your IP\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code>1. Open CMD (Windows + R → type \"cmd\" → Enter)\n2. Type: ipconfig\n3. Find \"IPv4 Address\" → That's your IP\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Example:</strong> If IP is <code>192.168.100.20</code> → Access <code>http://192.168.100.20:8000</code></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">🔧 First Time Setup</h3><a id=\"user-content--first-time-setup\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🔧 First Time Setup\" href=\"#-first-time-setup\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git clone https://github.com/linhbq82/Antibridge_Remote_Antigravity.git\ncd Antibridge_Remote_Antigravity\nnpm install\"><pre>git clone https://github.com/linhbq82/Antibridge_Remote_Antigravity.git\n<span clas